  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nModern Electric Tattoo, based in the heart of Bromsgrove, United Kingdom, is an eccentric tattoo studio known for pushing the boundaries of traditional design. Specializing in styles such as Trashpolka, Realism, and Black & Grey, their team of dynamic artists create striking, unique pieces that reflect the contemporary edge of their approach. With an inviting ambiance, Modern Electric Tattoo ensures an experience that is as unique as the ink they craft.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Bromsgrove, England, United Kingdom"
